  EIA -.->|"figures by hand · CSV"| PR
  RT -.->|"planned · new rows"| PR
  NE -.->|"npm"| S5
  S5 -.->|"GeoJSON · commit"| D10
  PR -->|"pull_request event"| W3
  W3 -->|"runs"| S4
